Related to your question and based on rule5, the covariance between dependent (endogenous) and independent (exogenous) latent variable is not model parameters. This is due to the fact that these covariances are themselves explained in terms of model (the regression coefficients GAMA between independent and dependent and BETA between dependent variables) parameters.HTH

