What if you label the intercepts, but do not constrain them to be equal? E.g.,
Post1~c1*1+b1*Pre1
Post2~c2*1+b2*Pre2
.
.
.
Post6~c6*1+b6*Pre6

Or break down the regression? E.g.
# constrained intercept estimation
Post1 + Post2 + ... + Post6 ~ c*1 # if you want to freely estimate the intercept, simply delete the label 'c'.

# slope estimation
Post1 ~ b1*Pre1
Post2 ~ b2*Pre2
.
.
.
Post6 ~ b6*Pre6

