I guess this means that either you should change the model (e.g., merge or split factors, change which item goes in which factor) or your sample size is small to this level of complexity. Your estimator is the standard "ML", right? Maybe changing to an estimator that is more robust to non-normality could help, but I wouldn't put much faith in that.

Just remember that this message is not an error message, it just says that you should interpret the results with care.

Best,
Yago

